  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Floating Bar (selection)",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "floating-bar-selection",
      "description": "Sticky app bar; peach-light inside a feature, white over the hero; stars mark sections.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-bar\"><span class=\"ds-bar-title\">Photo tracks</span><span class=\"ds-bar-count\">3 photos</span><span class=\"ds-bar-stars\"><a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Photo tracks\" class=\"ds-star on\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01z\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Local-first\" class=\"ds-star\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01z\"/></svg></a><a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Fast performance\" class=\"ds-star\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01z\"/></svg></a></span><button class=\"ds-bar-btn\" disabled>Get Qeepa</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-bar{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;height:48px;padding:0 6px 0 20px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--peach-light);box-shadow:0px 10px 30px rgba(43,38,33,0.14);transition:background-color .25s cubic-bezier(.42,0,.58,1)}.ds-bar-title{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:var(--text-primary)}.ds-bar-count{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:13px;line-height:16px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-bar-stars{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex}.ds-star{display:flex;width:24px;height:24px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:9999px;color:#6F3B0F2E;transition:color .15s}.ds-star.on,.ds-star:hover{color:var(--raw)}.ds-star:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--peach-accent)}.ds-bar-btn{margin-left:auto;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:rgba(43,38,33,0.06);padding:9px 20px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:13px;line-height:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-tertiary);cursor:not-allowed}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Track Pill",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "track-pill",
      "description": "The app's RAW/JPG/EDIT switcher; the page's recurring component.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pill\"><button class=\"ds-seg on\"><span class=\"ds-dot\" style=\"background:var(--raw)\"></span>RAW</button><button class=\"ds-seg\"><span class=\"ds-dot\" style=\"background:var(--jpg)\"></span>JPG</button><button class=\"ds-seg\"><span class=\"ds-dot\" style=\"background:var(--af)\"></span>EDIT</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px;border-radius:9999px;border:1px solid rgba(43,38,33,0.10);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.96);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(43,38,33,0.08),0 10px 28px -4px rgba(43,38,33,0.28)}.ds-seg{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:24px;padding:7px 18px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:13px;line-height:16px;color:var(--text-secondary);cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s,background-color .15s}.ds-seg:hover{color:var(--text-primary)}.ds-seg.on{background:var(--peach-accent);color:var(--peach-dark)}.ds-seg:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--peach-accent)}.ds-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:9999px;flex-shrink:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Photo Frame",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "photo-frame",
      "description": "Flat warm tone with track dot, rating pips and frame number standing in for a photo.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-frame\" style=\"background:#FCF5ED\"><span class=\"ds-fdot\"></span><span class=\"ds-pips\"><i class=\"f\"></i><i class=\"f\"></i><i class=\"f\"></i><i class=\"f\"></i><i></i></span><span class=\"ds-fnum\">4821</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-frame{position:relative;width:223px;aspect-ratio:3/2;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid #2B262114}.ds-fdot{position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--raw)}.ds-pips{position:absolute;left:10px;bottom:9px;display:flex;gap:2px}.ds-pips i{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:1px;background:#2B26211F}.ds-pips i.f{background:#EEA767}.ds-fnum{position:absolute;right:10px;bottom:8px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:9px;line-height:12px;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--text-tertiary)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "App Window",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "app-window",
      "description": "Window strip with muted traffic lights over an 18px-inset frame grid; open-edged in the hero.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-win\"><div class=\"ds-winbar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"ds-wingrid\"><div style=\"background:#FCF5ED\"></div><div style=\"background:#FEFAF6\"></div><div style=\"background:#F9EEE1\"></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-win{width:560px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;border:1px solid rgba(43,38,33,0.10);border-bottom:0;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(43,38,33,0.05),0 28px 64px -24px rgba(43,38,33,0.20)}.ds-winbar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;height:46px;padding:0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(43,38,33,0.08)}.ds-winbar i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:9999px;background:rgba(43,38,33,0.15)}.ds-wingrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;padding:18px}.ds-wingrid div{aspect-ratio:3/2;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid #2B262114}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Panel with Proportion Bar",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "White panel; peach-on-peach bars always printed with their percentage.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-row\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Aperture · 62%</span><span class=\"ds-val\">f/2.8</span></div><div class=\"ds-track\"><div class=\"ds-fill\" style=\"width:62%\"></div></div><div class=\"ds-gear\"><span class=\"ds-gchip\">Canon EOS R6 <b>318</b></span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{width:420px;padding:20px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid rgba(43,38,33,0.10);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(43,38,33,0.05),0 24px 56px -24px rgba(43,38,33,0.20);font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}.ds-lbl{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary)}.ds-val{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-primary);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-track{margin-top:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:#FDECD9;overflow:hidden}.ds-fill{height:100%;border-radius:9999px;background:#FCBA7F}.ds-gear{margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(43,38,33,0.07)}.ds-gchip{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--surface-2);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary)}.ds-gchip b{font-weight:500}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-chip",
      "description": "Surface-2 at rest; peach-light with peach-dark label when applied.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-chip\">Unrated</button> <button class=\"ds-chip on\">Portfolio</button>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:24px;padding:6px 12px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--surface-2);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-secondary);cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s,background-color .15s}.ds-chip:hover{color:var(--text-primary)}.ds-chip.on{background:var(--peach-light);color:var(--peach-dark)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--peach-accent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Qeepa (disabled)",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-get-disabled",
      "description": "The bar's only button; disabled until there is something to get.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-get\" disabled>Get Qeepa</button>",
      "css": ".ds-get{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 20px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:rgba(43,38,33,0.06);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:13px;line-height:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-tertiary);cursor:not-allowed}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Sunlit Gallery",
    "overview": "The site shows the product demonstrating itself on a white page. Every visual is a piece of the app's own interface: a window with muted traffic lights, a grid of near-white photo frames, the track pill, a file listing, an insights panel, a filter toolbar. None of it is a framed screenshot on a plinth. Copy ranges left on a single 120px rail. Each feature gets a full row, never a card, and the rows alternate sides down the page. The page ends with a status line, not a call to action, because there is nothing to download yet.\n\nThe material is warm and light. Photographs are stood in for by flat, near-white warm tones. What makes a tone read as a photo rather than a swatch is its metadata chrome: a track dot, rating pips, a frame number. The only non-warm colours on the page are the functional JPG and EDIT track dots. Depth comes from soft, warm-tinted shadows under objects the app would float. Surfaces themselves stay flat.\n\nMotion shares one physics vocabulary with the app. Loops demonstrate a claim, pause on hover or focus, and stop under reduced motion. Server HTML always shows a settled, legible state, and nothing is hidden unless JavaScript is present and motion is welcome.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White ground, one warm family, three functional track colours.",
      "Satoshi Bold display with tight negative tracking. Erode appears only in the wordmark and the floating bar's section names.",
      "Flat light tones with metadata chrome stand in for photographs. No gradients, no imagery.",
      "App chrome (window, pill, bar, chips) is the recurring material, taken from the product rather than invented.",
      "One motion registry, enforced by a test."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Warm-Only Rule",
        "body": "Everything is warm (hue 15 to 45) except the JPG and EDIT track dots, which earn their colour by carrying meaning. `tones.test.ts` enforces this for the tone family and the bar colours.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Light-Tone Rule",
        "body": "A photo stand-in stays above 75% lightness. A tone dark enough to compete with the type has stopped being a photo and become a block of colour.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Printed-Number Rule",
        "body": "The proportion bar's peach-on-peach pair is 1.46:1, below the 3:1 floor for graphics. That is acceptable only because every bar has its percentage printed beside it (\"Aperture · 62%\"). `InsightsPanel.test.tsx` fails if a bar ever loses its number, and at that point the fill has to darken.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No-Kicker Rule",
        "body": "No small label sits above a heading anywhere. The subheading is always below the title. Stated in `copy.ts` and `FeatureRow.astro`.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Curly-Apostrophe Rule",
        "body": "All copy lives in `src/lib/copy.ts`, uses curly apostrophes, and never states a price, a date or social proof. `copy.test.ts` enforces all three.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Warm-Shadow Rule",
        "body": "A shadow is tinted with the ink colour, and every shadow on a page object has two layers. A neutral-grey shadow never appears.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** take every duration, easing, spring, delay and travel distance from `src/lib/motion.ts`. In CSS, read the variables from `motionCssVariables()`. `motion-discipline.test.ts` fails on inlined values in demo, site, page and layout code.",
      "**Do** render photographs as `PhotoFrame` tones and windows through `WindowBar`, so the chrome has one owner.",
      "**Do** derive any count the bar states from `src/lib/tiles.ts`, so it equals the frames actually drawn. The only exception is the performance strip, which names the shoot (1127). `tiles.test.ts` guards this.",
      "**Do** keep new tones warm (hue 15 to 45), above 75% lightness, and inside the gallery's 8-point band (`tones.test.ts`).",
      "**Do** give every control a 2px `:focus-visible` ring in peach-accent, a 24px minimum hit area, and 44px on coarse pointers via `extend-touch-target-y`.",
      "**Do** pair every colour signal with text: track dots with labels, bars with printed percentages, stars with section names.",
      "**Do** judge text contrast with APCA and record the reading when a pairing changes.",
      "**Do** make every loop pausable (hover, focus and its own control) and still under reduced motion."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** put a kicker or eyebrow above a heading.",
      "**Don't** use gradients as photo stand-ins. They read as swatches at any size.",
      "**Don't** add a colour outside the warm family other than the track dots, and don't use grey hairlines or neutral shadows.",
      "**Don't** lay feature content in a grid of equal cards, or present the product as a floating framed screenshot.",
      "**Don't** split rows into two columns below xl.",
      "**Don't** add a live download, buy or signup control, a price, a date, testimonials or a logomark. None exist, and Get Qeepa stays disabled until one does.",
      "**Don't** hide server-rendered content that isn't gated behind `.js` and a motion preference, and don't start a Motion animation from opacity 0 on first render.",
      "**Don't** add a sixth spring preset without asking first."
    ]
  }
}
